"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]事态紧急？你发现什么了吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","img":"chara038_1_face_chara038_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":640,"mirrow":false,"y":-418,"img":"chara038_1","addImg":"chara038_1_face_chara038_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"瓦菲诺","text":"[show]这事还要从前几天说起，当时我在调查秋日荒野野外魔力的流向，结果发现魔力似乎在有规律地朝南方移动。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"瓦菲诺","text":"[show]当时我以为那些魔力流向了索利德山或者魔爪湖畔，但根据这两地调查队的报告，那边并没有流出的魔力，而且那边的魔力似乎也朝着秋日荒野涌来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"瓦菲诺","text":"[show]也就是说……秋日荒野、索利德山、魔爪湖畔的交界处可能有什么东西，让三地的魔力一同涌入其中。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","img":"chara038_1_face_chara038_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"瓦菲诺","text":"[show]我初步推断那里可能有新的匠器，但我和调查队去那里探索了好几次，结果一无所获……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":640,"mirrow":false,"y":-418,"img":"chara038_1","addImg":"chara038_1_face_chara038_1d"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]明明已经知道魔力的交汇处了，你们居然什么都没找到吗？莫非和安瑟恩遗迹一样是在地底下？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":640,"mirrow":false,"y":-418,"img":"chara038_1","addImg":"chara038_1_face_chara038_1d"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"瓦菲诺","text":"[show]不知道，那边除了一片大雾都什么都没有，就连我们原先准备好的仪器都失灵了。我判断那神秘存在可能存在着某种保护机制，我们不用点手段是找不到的。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_11","text":"所以……"},{"tag":"tag_11","text":"我就是你们要找的手段了？"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","img":"chara038_1_face_chara038_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"瓦菲诺","text":"[cm][show]准确来说，是你手上的工匠锤。毕竟能将这么大规模的魔力汇聚在一起，还设下保护机制，除了那些先时工匠之外不会有其他人能做到了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"瓦菲诺","text":"[show]虽然我不确定是不是百分百有效果，但眼下我也没有别的办法了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"瓦菲诺","text":"[show]那么……两位可以立刻出发吗？和我之前说的一样，这件事很紧急，那地方要是被别人先发现就很麻烦了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":640,"mirrow":false,"y":-418,"img":"chara038